<AppPageLayout
  app="TolaVR Player"
  title="Privacy policy"
  updated="1 October 2026"
  description="How TolaVR Player handles your data: it collects nothing."
>
  <p>
    TolaVR Player is a VR video player for Apple Vision Pro with a built-in web browser, published by
    Megakad Consulting Ltd (“we”). We built it so that your data stays with you.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Nothing.</strong> TolaVR Player has no accounts, no analytics, no advertising and no third-party
    tracking or SDKs. We don't receive any information about you, the sites you visit or the videos you
    watch.
  </p>

  <h2>What stays on your device</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Your bookmarks, the last page you visited, and player settings (position, zoom, roll, height, 3D depth
      and format choices).
    </li>
    <li>
      Website data such as cookies and sign-ins, kept by the browser so you stay signed in to your sites.
      Private mode keeps this in memory only and forgets it when you leave private mode.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    You can remove website data at any time with “Clear cookies and data” in the app's menu, or remove
    everything by deleting the app.
  </p>

  <h2>Websites you visit</h2>
  <p>
    When you browse or play a video, your device connects directly to that website, as a normal browser
    does. Those websites have their own privacy policies, which apply to what they collect.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>TolaVR Player isn't directed at children and contains an unrestricted web browser.</p>

  <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes we'll update this page and the date above. Questions:
    <a href="mailto:support@megakad.com">support@megakad.com</a>.
  </p>
</AppPageLayout>
